{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/revised-direction-issued-to-sandwell-council-2019","content_id":"785440b9-df27-4ace-b3c7-d8a5f4445fa0","description":"A statutory direction reissued to Sandwell Council to reflect that the council entered into a regional adoption agency on 1 April 2019.","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternative.formats@education.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6a563b48822fbe6b8245c8fb","filename":"Revised_direction_issued_to_Sandwell_borough_council.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":2487269,"filename":"Revised_direction_issued_to_Sandwell_borough_council.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9393877","isbn":"","number_of_pages":16,"title":"Revised direction issued to Sandwell Metropolitan Borough Council","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a563b48822fbe6b8245c8fb/Revised_direction_issued_to_Sandwell_borough_council.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><div class=\"call-to-action\">\n  <p>This direction was revoked on 17 July 2026 and is no longer in force.</p>\n\n  <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/sandwell-childrens-trust-improvement-advisers-report\">Sandwell Children’s Trust: improvement advisers’ report</a> includes information on the progress and performance of Sandwell.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>This revised direction sets out the services agreement between the council and the Sandwell Children’s Trust from 1 April 2019, regarding operational responsibilities for children’s social care functions. It now reflects the role of the Adoption@Heart Regional Adoption Agency in these arrangements.</p>\n\n<p>This direction replaces <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/direction-issued-to-sandwell-metropolitan-borough-council--2\">earlier statutory directions</a> issued to the council, most recently in March 2018.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"This direction has been revoked and is no longer in force. ","public_timestamp":"2026-07-17T11:00:02Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2019-07-14T23:00:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","emphasised_organisations":["ebd15ade-73b2-4eaf-b1c3-43034a42eb37"],"featured_attachments":["9393877"],"first_public_at":"2019-07-15T00:00:00.000+01:00","national_applicability":{"england":{"applicable":true,"label":"England"},"northern_ireland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Northern Ireland"},"scotland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Scotland"},"wales":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Wales"}},"political":false,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"correspondence","first_published_at":"2019-07-15T00:00:00+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/revised-direction-issued-to-sandwell-council-2019","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/revised-direction-issued-to-sandwell-council-2019","base_path":"/government/publications/revised-direction-issued-to-sandwell-council-2019","content_id":"785440b9-df27-4ace-b3c7-d8a5f4445fa0","document_type":"correspondence","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-17T11:00:02Z","schema_name":"publication","title":"Revised direction issued to Sandwell Council: 2019","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/revised-direction-issued-to-sandwell-council-2019","withdrawn":false}],"document_collections":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/collections/improvement-notices","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/collections/improvement-notices","base_path":"/government/collections/improvement-notices","content_id":"5eb616c8-7631-11e4-a3cb-005056011aef","document_type":"document_collection","links":{"documents":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/revise